Speaking of moats....  I had a vortex carry me over one.  When I
killed the vortex, I was over the moat.  I should have died at this
point, but nothing interesting happened.  I was able to simply move
out of the water, with no ill effects.

Also, I find that if I am levitating over a moat, I can #dip stuff
into it.  I would think that this shouldn't work.  I should be
"floating high over the moat."  On the other hand, if I am next to a
moat, I should be able to dip stuff into it without entering the
square with the water symbol.  Perhaps it should work using the same
code as #untrap, for picking a direction & such once you've picked an
item to #dip.

